/**
 * @defgroup RoModular_Repositories_Build RoModularBuild
 * @ingroup RoModular_Repositories
 * @brief Versioned build, toolchain, workflow, and CI infrastructure.
 *
 * | Field | Value |
 * | ----- | ----- |
 * | Role | Project-independent CMake, toolchain, workflow, and CI mechanics |
 * | Current validated release | `v0.6.2` |
 * | Status | Active; shared embedded support validated by CPSTL |
 * | Source | [ChecheRomo96/RoModularBuild](https://github.com/ChecheRomo96/RoModularBuild) |
 * | Documentation | [Documentation directory](https://github.com/ChecheRomo96/RoModularBuild/tree/v0.6.2/docs) |
 * | Consumers | CPSTL, Foundation, DspCore, MCC and MIDILAR |
 *
 * RoModularBuild defines reusable compiler, architecture, ABI, preset-base,
 * lifecycle, and cross-platform CI behavior. Consumers pin an exact tag or
 * commit. Public preset names, feature options, application firmware, package policy,
 * hardware evidence and release policy stay in each consumer. Reusable startup,
 * linker/runtime support, artifact conversion and programmer transports are shared.
 */
